Speedy the Rollerskater - credits
=================================

Speedy the Rollerskater (Full Version) is by SynfigMaster91, made with the
Open Surge Engine. Its page, where the original Windows download is:

  https://sonicfangameshq.com/forums/showcase/speedy-the-rollerskater.977/

The author's terms, as written on that page and in the game's README!!!.txt:

  "This game is free and open source. It means you can share, study and
   modify/fix something you don't like or you think it needs a fix.
   If you share or put this game in somewhere, please give me credit."

This AmigaOS 3 package shares the game unchanged apart from what OpenSurge
0.6.1 needs to run it (the Windows program files are left out, the menu
script's MenuButtonList declaration is updated and a surge.cfg is added).
All credit for the game goes to SynfigMaster91 and the people below.

Game created by SynfigMaster91. Engine by Alexandre Martins (Open Surge
Engine and SurgeScript, https://opensurge2d.org/). The game's own credits,
from its credits.txt (Licences/speedy-credits.txt in the package), follow.

